[h1]Living Fellows 0.26.69[/h1]

[list]
[*]Optional compatibility with the official Bandits2 core for Project Zomboid 42.21.0 single-player. Companions, residents, households and Strange Folk recognize Bandits as people, with distinct identities, protected friendly firing lanes and Bandits' original damage rules. Integration activates automatically when supported interfaces are present and can be turned off in Options.
[*]Improved ordinary companion shooting. Firearms use the companion's own aim and muzzle position, and aim at standing targets' chests. Native accuracy rolls, armor and damage remain in charge.
[*]Hold Fire also applies against hostile humans, while preserving close shove defense.
[*]Right-click a marked container and choose Living Fellows → Base life → Unmark storage. The container and contents stay in place. Storage still needed by a job gives a readable explanation.
[*]Full Bandits live acceptance and driving expedition return safety remain open. The reported persistent isometric moonwalking has not been reproduced or fixed. Completed checks and remaining scenarios are recorded in the repository's validation documents.
[*]Includes the matching 0.26.69 native bridge. Project Zomboid 42.21.0, existing save schemas and bridge protocol 42.21-isocompanion-24 are unchanged.
[/list]
